constructor
  ├── it should set i_thisChainSelector
  ├── it should set i_link
  ├── it should set i_asset
  ├── it should set i_assetPrecision
  ├── it should set the CCIP router
  ├── it should set the emergency receiver
  ├── it should grant DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE to defaultAdmin
  ├── it should grant PAUSER_ROLE to pauser  
  ├── it should grant UNPAUSER_ROLE to unpauser  
  ├── it should grant CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE to configOperator
  ├── it should set s_defaultCcipGasLimit
  ├── it should set the deposit nonce to 1
  ├── it should set the withdraw nonce to 1
  ├── when LINK is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when asset is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when CCIP router is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with InvalidRouter
  ├── when pauser is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when unpauser is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when config operator is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when adapter registry is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when this chain selector is zero
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroChainSelector
  ├── when emergency receiver is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  └── when initial default CCIP gas limit is zero
      └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAmount
